# Testing rules

See [agent/TESTING.md](agent/TESTING.md) for full conventions.

## Environment

```bash
conda activate general   # maintainer example; any Python 3.10+ env works
pip install -e ".[test]"
pytest
```

Run `pytest` after every change to touched modules.

## Golden vector

- `WORKED_FIELDS` and `WORKED_WORDS` in `tests/conftest.py` — single source
- `WORKED_WORDS[n]` = register Rn; full SPI sequence = `reversed(WORKED_WORDS)`
- Do not duplicate hex words in docs or duplicate `FakeDevice` in test files

## Style

- `Test{FeatureArea}` classes
- `@pytest.mark.parametrize` for profiles and edges

## Invariants to test

- Solver → configure → encode → commit chain matches golden vector
- DBR/DBB forces trailing R0 when R1/R2/R4 divider change
- In-band sweep hops: single R0 write
- SPI failure: `mark_write_failed`, cache unchanged
